# Title: Docker Container Discovery Via Dockerenv Listing
# ID: 11701de9-d5a5-44aa-8238-84252f131895
# Status: test
# Level: low
# Author: Seth Hanford
# Date: 2023-08-23
# Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1082
# Description: Detects listing or file reading of ".dockerenv" which can be a sing of potential container discovery
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((process_name:*/cat OR process_name:*/dir OR process_name:*/find OR process_name:*/ls OR process_name:*/stat OR process_name:*/test OR process_name:*grep) AND cmdline:*.dockerenv)
